    "sections": {
        "description": "Learn Education Business, a child theme derived from the Bizberg WordPress Theme, is a clean, modern, and highly flexible free education school WordPress theme that is widely recognized as one of the best WordPress theme for education websites. It is designed to meet the needs of universities, colleges, schools, training centers, coaching institutes, workshops, and online learning platforms, while also being suitable for selling books, promoting courses, and managing tuition or eLearning services. This free education WordPress theme is fully responsive, ensuring a smooth and user-friendly experience across desktops, tablets, and mobile devices, and it is cross-browser compatible, translation-ready, and built with SEO best practices to help your website rank higher in search engines. With seamless Elementor integration, users can easily customize layouts, sections, and content without any coding knowledge. Backed by detailed documentation and reliable support, Learn Education Business offers a professional, scalable, and feature-rich solution for creating an engaging educational website, making it an excellent choice for anyone searching for a free school WordPress theme, a free education WordPress theme with demo content, or the best WordPress theme for education and online courses."
